    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1449">

                <pb facs="1157" n="1147" xml:id="pg1147"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.953/9–3049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Consul at Tsingtao</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hawthorne</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-30T18:00:00-05:00">September 30,
                            1949—6 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>298. Dept considers it necessary for you close office immed and depart soonest
                    reDeptel 271, Sep 14.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d1449-f1"/> Inform Dept soonest when
                    and how you and staff expect depart. Sep[arate] tel fols personnel assignments.
                    Inform Dept whether difficulties encountered in obtaining exit permits or if any
                    Dept action necessary assist departure.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
